 {{Illucraft|name=Phantom Lancer Spirit Lance|t=5}}

* {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
** Creates a Spirit Lance-based [[illusion]] upon a successful [[projectile]] impact.
** Reapplying the debuff refreshes its duration.
** {{Symbol|Illusions}}
*** Has a fixed {{Gold|5}} and {{XP|5}} illusion bounty.

* {{hi|Phantom Lancer}} {{Symbol|Illusions}}
** [[File:Dota2_Cast_Range_to_AoE_Visualization_icon-4-1.png|84px]][[File:Dota2_Cast_Range_to_AoE_Visualization_icon-4-2.png|84px]]
*** All of Azwraith's [[illusions]] within {{#var:Spirit Lance type2 value1}} distance of the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] also casts Spirit Lance with the following properties:
**** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
**** Illusions' Spirit Lance damage is affected by their outgoing damage penalty.
**** If they have no orders or standing still, the illusions {{M|Turn Rate|text=turn}}, {{M|Facing Angle|text=face}} the target, then cast the ability.
**** If they have move orders or attack orders, the orders continue until Spirit Lance's {{M|cast point}}, then overrides their current orders upon the ability's {{M|cast backswing}}.
**** When canceling the ability cast, they play the full {{M|cast animation}} but do not release the projectile.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** The ability effects are applied as follows:
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|phantom_lancer_spirit_lance}}
**# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
**#* {{cf|talnotes}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Spirit Lance icon0}}
| desc = Sends a magical spirit lance to a target enemy unit that damages and slows, while summoning an illusory phantom to attack the unit.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** Has {{#var:Spirit Lance basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed}}.

* The created [[illusion]] has the following distances apart to the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy's correspondingly to the caster's {{M|collision size}}:
{{Colsizecard}}

