fields.value:
 {{Illucraft|name=Illusions (Doppelganger)|t=4|text=Illusion Eins}}

* The ability has three components:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} + {{Symbol|Illusions}}
*** Applies the following ability effects on Azwraith and all of his current [[illusions]]:
***# {{M|Disjoints}} incoming {{M|projectiles}} upon cast.
***# Applies the following ability effects during the {{#var:Doppelganger value3}}-second reappear time:
***#* {{M|Attack immune}}
***#* {{M|Hidden}}
***#* {{M|Invulnerable}}
***#* {{M|Stun}}
***#* {{M|Unselectable}}
***# All affected units now {{M|cannot act}}, any order given is queued as the next order.
***# Applies a {{M|basic dispel}}.
***# {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}}
***#* Reappears with [[File:Dota2 Illusions (Doppelganger) icon.png|21px]] Ilusion Eins and  [[File:Dota2 Illusions (Spirit Lance) icon.png|21px]] Illusion Zwei facing the same direction as Azwraith.
***#* Other illusions keep their previous facing angle.
***#* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
***#** Illusion Eins is brighter and distinguishable ally-only.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** The ability cannot be interrupted upon cast, except upon Azwraith's {{M|death}}.
*** {{Symbol|Illusions}}
**** The illusion duration extension is applied upon cast, effectively increasing all gathered illusions' duration by {{#expr:{{#var:Doppelganger value4}}-{{#var:Doppelganger value3}}}} second with the reappear time.
**** [[File:Dota2 Illusions (Doppelganger) icon.png|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Illusions (Spirit Lance) icon.png|21px]]
***** Both Eins and Zwei have a fixed {{Gold|5}} and {{XP|5}} illusion bounty.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-3.png|3|21px]] {{hi|Phantom Lancer}} {{Symbol|Illusions}}
*** All affected units reappear randomly within a {{Code|+}}-shaped formation, with a bit of variation.
*** Azwraith and his illusions auto-attack the nearest enemy unit within a 600-radius except Manta Style illusions.
*** {{Symbol|Trees}}
**** [[Trees]] within a 200-radius of Azwraith and every affected illusion upon reappearing are destroyed.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Doppelganger icon0}}
| desc = Phantom Lancer briefly vanishes from the battlefield. After 1 second, Phantom Lancer and any of his nearby illusions reappear at a random position within the targeted location, along with two additional doppelgangers. Extends duration of all illusions. The two added doppelgangers have different properties: one takes normal damage and deals none, while the other takes 500% bonus damage and deals -80% less damage.
}}
* {{Symbol|Illusions}}
** The illusion creating component has the following additional abilities:
**# The wielder first reappears in game, with its {{M|current health}} bar visible, in the random position within the fixed illusion formation.
**# {{Symbol|fx|v}}
**#* These created illusions now plays the hero spawn animation.
**#* Grants illusions particle effects accordingly to the hero model, then the health bars.

